    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Echoes of Mora brings the fantasy of diving into a mysterious underwater world to life. Swim through a flooded, abandoned village, find hidden objects, and uncover secrets in this atmospheric narrative adventure. Whether you choose VR or non-VR mode\u2014join young Mora in her quest to find her missing brother across the boundaries of time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/e5dcb379babbe1139bc7383e346af33d.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Search for clues about the village's story, solve puzzles, and unlock Echoes to see the events before the flood. Inside these time portals, experience the village's beauty before the tragedy, hear villagers' conversations, and communicate with Mora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her brother disappears near a cursed violet lake, Mora sets out to find him. As the lake's water rises, threatening the village, your help is crucial. Share clues you find in the underwater world, guide Mora in the past, and accompany her on a\u00a0time-bending journey that could decide the flood's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/9a96fa971cc9d9e46041c4b6fa8670f9.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in VR mode to fully immerse yourself in the rich world of Echoes of Mora. Using motion-tracking, you can move your arms to smoothly navigate the sunken landscape and enjoy lots of intriguing interactions with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a full PC-only mode, and you can effortlessly switch between VR and PC mode at any time during your play session, giving you complete freedom to choose how you explore the underwater world.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/89027832da2c65c85f14302c70ffb151.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a captivating underwater world with an emotional story about a sibling duo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, unlock Echoes to travel back in time &amp; collect hidden clues to unravel the story behind Mora's missing brother</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive swimming controls with motion tracking in VR mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Mora in the past to shape the fate of the village &amp; influence the course of the flood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between VR &amp; non-VR mode at any time during the same play session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all PC-based VR headsets</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ef9dafef94f72a3e27710f09422be7c9.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Echoes of Mora brings the fantasy of diving into a mysterious underwater world to life. Swim through a flooded, abandoned village, find hidden objects, and uncover secrets in this atmospheric narrative adventure. Whether you choose VR or non-VR mode\u2014join young Mora in her quest to find her missing brother across the boundaries of time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/e5dcb379babbe1139bc7383e346af33d.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/7e67f66c504051ceb037809e9c6f79de.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Search for clues about the village's story, solve puzzles, and unlock Echoes to see the events before the flood. Inside these time portals, experience the village's beauty before the tragedy, hear villagers' conversations, and communicate with Mora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her brother disappears near a cursed violet lake, Mora sets out to find him. As the lake's water rises, threatening the village, your help is crucial. Share clues you find in the underwater world, guide Mora in the past, and accompany her on a\u00a0time-bending journey that could decide the flood's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/9a96fa971cc9d9e46041c4b6fa8670f9.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.poster.avif?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a9c1dfb2ec16342fc24d2f0e5f87727c.webm?t=1755531504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in VR mode to fully immerse yourself in the rich world of Echoes of Mora. Using motion-tracking, you can move your arms to smoothly navigate the sunken landscape and enjoy lots of intriguing interactions with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a full PC-only mode, and you can effortlessly switch between VR and PC mode at any time during your play session, giving you complete freedom to choose how you explore the underwater world.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/89027832da2c65c85f14302c70ffb151.webp?t=1755531504\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a captivating underwater world with an emotional story about a sibling duo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, unlock Echoes to travel back in time &amp; collect hidden clues to unravel the story behind Mora's missing brother</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive swimming controls with motion tracking in VR mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Mora in the past to shape the fate of the village &amp; influence the course of the flood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between VR &amp; non-VR mode at any time during the same play session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with all PC-based VR headsets</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a mysterious journey, filled with intriguing interactions and meaningful encounters, as you explore a sunken village and travel through time to help Mora find her lost brother. Playable in VR and non-VR on PC.",
